# LoC MARC relator code → MTS role bridge with multilingual labels.
#
# Links Library of Congress MARC relator codes (<http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/{code}>)
# to Finto Metatietosanasto (MTS) role concepts (<http://urn.fi/URN:NBN:fi:au:mts:{id}>).
#
# Parallel to vocab/loc-issuance-bridge.ttl, vocab/loc-countries-bridge.ttl, and
# vocab/loc-languages-bridge.ttl.
#
# Source: Finto Metatietosanasto (MTS) RDA roles and LoC MARC Relators.
#
# Licence: CC0 (project bridge; MTS labels are NLF / Finto CC0).

@prefix loc:  <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/relators/> .
@prefix mts:  <http://urn.fi/URN:NBN:fi:au:mts:> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

@prefix bridge: <http://urn.fi/URN:NBN:fi:bib:bridge/loc-relators/> .

bridge: a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    rdfs:label "Local LoC MARC relator code ↔ MTS bridge"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Project-owned bridge linking LoC MARC relator codes to Finto Metatietosanasto (MTS) role concepts."@en .

